<title>UK: UK's Pantheon names Swire executive chairman.</title>
<headline>UK's Pantheon names Swire executive chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialist private equity investment management and advisory firm Pantheon Group said on Wednesday it had appointed Rhoddy Swire as executive chairman.</p>
<p>Pantheon also said it had appointed David Braman and Richard Bowley as joint managing directors.</p>
<p>Swire succeeds Richard Thompson, who remains as a non-executive director.</p>
<p>Pantheon has in excess of $1 billion under advice and management in private equity.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom, +171 542 2734</p>
